  "ai_language_tip": "Speak clear, polite standard Romanian (ro) in both countries; in Moldova (md) Russian is very common in Chișinău, Bălți, Gagauzia and Transnistria-adjacent areas, so switch to Russian if the owner answers in it; English works in Bucharest, Cluj and hotels.",
  "english_ok": "sometimes — Good among younger staff in Bucharest, Cluj, Timișoara and Chișinău centre and at hotels; limited at state clinics, offices and in villages.",
  "politeness": "Use 'dumneavoastră', 'domnule/doamnă'; open with 'Bună ziua' and say for whom you call; close with 'Mulțumesc, la revedere'. In Russian use 'вы'.",
  "name_tip": "Surname is often given first in bookings ('pe numele Popescu'); spell foreign names letter by letter; in Russian-speaking Moldova expect patronymic-free first name + surname.",
  "phone_tip": "ro: mobile 07xx xxx xxx (10 digits with 0), +40; md: mobile 06x/07x xx xx xx (9 digits with 0), Chișinău landline 022, +373; read in groups.",
  "time_tip": "'șapte și jumătate' = 7:30 and 'opt fără un sfert' = 7:45 (no half-before trap in Romanian); Russian 'в половине восьмого' = 7:30 is a trap; read back in 24h.",
  "number_tip": "Romanian uses 'de' from 20 up ('douăzeci de persoane'); 'doi/două' change with gender; prices in lei (RON in ro, MDL in md), so say which currency.",
  "avoid_calling": "Avoid lunch 12:00–14:00 at small offices, dinner peak 19:00–21:00, calls after 20:00 and Sundays for offices; state clinics answer best early morning.",
  "closed_days": "Shops and malls open on Sundays in both countries; state offices close weekends; Orthodox Easter and Pentecost (moving dates), 1 and 6–7 January, 24 January, 1 May, 1 June, 15 August, 30 November, 1 December, 25–26 December (ro) and 9 May, 27 August, 31 August (md) close many businesses.",
  "booking_channels": "Regina Maria and MedLife apps/call centres for private clinics in ro; phone, Facebook, Instagram and WhatsApp for restaurants and salons; Glovo, Wolt and Bolt Food for delivery in ro; EasyReserv and phone/Viber/Telegram in md.",
  "voice_menu": "Operators (Orange, Vodafone, Digi; Moldcell, Orange MD), banks, Fan Courier/Sameday and the private clinic chains use keypad IVR and call centres.",
  "callback_habits": "Private clinics send SMS reminders; small businesses confirm by SMS, WhatsApp (ro) or Viber/Telegram (md) or call back from a mobile.",
